{"speciesId":260,"names":{"fr":"Laggron","es":"Swampert","en":"Swampert","ja":"ラグラージ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SWAMPERT is very strong. It has enough power to easily drag a boulder weighing more than a ton. This POKéMON also has powerful vision that lets it see even in murky water."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SWAMPERT predicts storms by sensing subtle differences in the sounds of waves and tidal winds with its fins. If a storm is approaching, it piles up boulders to protect itself."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its arms are rock-hard. With one swing, they can batter down its foe. It makes its nest on beautiful beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its arms are rock-hard. With one swing, they can batter down its foe. It makes its nest on beautiful beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il peut traîner un grand bateau en nageant. Il assomme l’ennemi d’un grand coup de ses bras épais."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut traîner un grand bateau en nageant. Il assomme l’ennemi d’un grand coup de ses bras épais."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un seul coup de ses puissants bras suffit pour pulvériser même les plus gros rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Con sus brazos duros como el acero puede partir rocas gigantescas en mil pedazos de un solo golpe."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"岩の ように 硬い 腕を 一振り するだけで 巨大な 岩を コナゴナに 砕くぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut traîner un grand bateau en nageant. Il assomme l’ennemi d’un grand coup de ses bras épais."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Puede nadar y arrastrar un barco grande. Golpea a sus enemigos con sus gruesos brazos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大型船を 引っ張って 泳ぐ パワーの 持ち主。太い 腕の 一振りで 相手を たたきのめす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Laggron est très fort. Tellement fort qu’il peut aisément tirer un rocher pesant plus d’une tonne. Ce Pokémon est également doté d’une vue si efficace qu’il peut même voir à travers l’eau trouble."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Swampert es muy fuerte. Puede arrastrar una roca que pese más de una tonelada sin ningún problema. Este Pokémon tiene el sentido de la vista muy desarrollado. Es capaz de ver hasta en aguas cenagosas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Swampert is very strong. It has enough power to easily drag a boulder weighing more than a ton. This Pokémon also has powerful vision that lets it see even in murky water."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"重さ １トン以上 ある 岩の 塊を 軽々 引っ張る パワーを 持つ ポケモンだ。 濁った 水中も 見通す 視力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Laggron peut prédire l’arrivée des tempêtes en utilisant ses nageoires pour sentir les variations dans les vagues et les marées. Si une tempête s’approche, il empile des rochers pour protéger son habitat."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swampert puede predecir tormentas al percibir con las aletas los sutiles cambios que producen las olas y las corrientes. Si está a punto de estallar una tormenta, empezará a apilar piedras para resguardarse."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swampert predicts storms by sensing subtle differences in the sounds of waves and tidal winds with its fins. If a storm is approaching, it piles up boulders to protect itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ラグラージは 波音や 潮風の わずかな 違いを ヒレで 感じ 嵐を 予感する。 嵐になると 岩を 積み上げ 巣を 守る。"}],"varieties":[{"id":260,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bod